# Victron VE.Direct for ESP32

ESP32 Bibliothek zum Auslesen von Victron-Geräten über VE.Direct.

## Features

- VE.Direct UART Reader
- Text Protocol Parser
- Field Catalog
- Value Conversion
- Off Reason Decoding
- Human Readable Output

## Unterstützte Geräte

- SmartSolar MPPT 100/50 (getestet)

## Roadmap

- SmartShunt
- Device Catalog
- MQTT
- Energy Manager